  <para style="h">Timoteo 2</para>
  <para style="toc1">Timoteo 2</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timoteo 2</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tim2</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteo 2</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo suɔmi ke ha Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Paulo nɛ ji Yesu Kristo bɔfo nɛ Mawu tsɔ kaa e ya fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ nyumuhi kɛ yihi tsuo ngɛ he fɛɛ he, nɛ e de mɛ neneene wami ɔ nɛ e wo mɛ he si kaa a nine maa su nɔ kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi nɔ ɔ, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />nɛ ngma e suɔmi bi Timoteo womi nɛ ɔ: Dloomi, mɔbɔ nami kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je Tsɛ Mawu kɛ wa Nutsɔ Kristo Yesu dɛ mi ɔ ha mo.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Timoteo, i naa Mawu si, nɛ i kpaa lɛ pɛɛ nyɔ kɛ pia si abɔ kaa e jɔɔ mo babauu. Lɛ ji ami kɛ ye tsɛmɛ a Mawu, nɛ e ji ye suɔmi kaa ma pee e suɔmi nya ni ngɛ ye wami si himi mi.<verse eid="2TI 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Nɛ ke i kai o hɛ mi vo ngu be mi nɛ wa mi ngɛ gbae ɔ, e peeɔ mi hɛ ja nɛ i hlaa kaa ma na mo ekohu nɛ ma na bua jɔmi.<verse eid="2TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />I le kaa hemi kɛ yemi nɛ o nyɛ Eunike kɛ o na Loise ngɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ ngɛ mo hu o mi, nɛ i heɔ yeɔ kaa o hɛɛ mi lolo.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ mo kaie kaa Mawu nɔ́ke nɔ ɔ nɛ sɛ o mi benɛ i wo ye nine ngɔ pue o nɔ nɛ i gbaa mo ɔ, o pɛtɛ he nɛ o ha nɛ e wa. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ji Mawu nɔ́ke nɔ ɔ, hla we kaa o ye nimli gbeye, se mohu o na nile kɛ mumi mi he wami nɛ o kɛ suɔ mɛ ngɛ bua jɔmi si himi mi. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Nɛ ke o pɛtɛ mumi mi he wami nɛ ɔ he saminya a, o be gbeye yee kaa o maa ye wa Nutsɔ ɔ he odase kɛ tsɔɔ nihi aloo o ma de mɛ nɛ a le kaa a wo mi tsu ngɛ Kristo he mohu, se o huɛ ji mi. Nɛ o pee klaalo kaa o kɛ mi maa na nɔ́ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ, ejakaa e maa wo mo he wami ngɛ nɔ nami ɔ mi.<verse eid="2TI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ he wa yi wami nɛ e tsɛ wɔ kɛ ha e ni tsumi klɔuklɔu ɔ, pi ngɛ sami nɛ wa sa a he, se mohu ja a ji bɔ nɛ e to he blɔ nya loko ji a bɔ je ɔ, kaa e maa tsɔɔ wɔ e mɔbɔ nami kɛ e suɔmi ɔ kɛ gu Kristo nɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, e gu wa Yiwamihelɔ Yesu Kristo bami ɔ nɔ kɛ je e yi mi tomi nɛ ɔ tsuo kpo paa kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ. Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ye gbenɔ he wami ɔ nɔ kunimi nɛ e tsɔɔ wɔ neneene wami nami blɔ kɛ gu e nɔ hemi kɛ yemi nɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Enɛ ɔ he nɛ Mawu hla mi ngɛ kaa e munyu ɔ fiɛlɔ kɛ tsɔɔlɔ ha ma je li ɔmɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ i ngɛ nɔ nami mi ngɛ tsu mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, nɛ e pee we mi zo, ejakaa i le nɔ nɛ nɔ nɛ i he ye. Nɛ i ngɛ he nɔ kami kaa e ma nyɛ bu nihi kulaa nɛ i to kɛ wo e dɛ mi ɔ he kɛ ya si be nɛ e maa kpale kɛ ba a.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Moo pɛtɛ anɔkuale ɔ nɛ i tsɔɔ mo ɔ he wawɛɛ, titli ɔ, hemi kɛ yemi kɛ suɔmi nɛ Kristo Yesu kɛ ha mo ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Nɛ o bu Mawu nɔ́ke nɔ kpakpa nɛ a to kɛ wo o dɛ mi ɔ he saminya. E ji nɔ́ke nɔ nɛ je Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ngɛ o mi ɔ mi.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Kaa bɔ nɛ o le ɔ, Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ kɛ mi je Asia kɛ ba hiɛ ɔ, a si ami nɔ kake ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. Fegelo kɛ Hermogene po si mi. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ gbaa Onesiforo kɛ e we ɔ tsuo, ejakaa e pee we lɛ zo kaa a wo mi tsu mi se mohu e ba slaa mi kpitikpiti nɛ e woɔ mi kã. E slaami ɔmɛ ngɛ kaa kɔɔhiɔ nɛ mi jɔ nɛ sɛɛ ye mi, nɛ e haa mi he wami. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Anɔkuale ji kaa benɛ e ba Roma a, e bɔ mɔde nɛ e hla mi ngɛ he fɛɛ he kɛ ya si benɛ e na mi. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ gbaa lɛ kɛ gbaami pɔtɛɛ ko ngɛ Kristo kpalemi kɛ bami ligbi ɔ nɔ. Nɛ o le pe bɔ nɛ i ma nyɛ de mo, bɔ nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi ngɛ Efeso ha.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo he wami ɔ nɛ ye kɛ bua mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Oo ye bi Timoteo, o he nɛ wa ngɛ Kristo Yesu he wami ɔ nɛ e kɛ wo o mi ɔ nya. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ejakaa o maa ye odase ngɛ níhi nɛ o kɛ ni kpa amɛ nu ngɛ ye nya a he. O tsɔɔ anɔkuale yeli ni ngua nɛ ɔmɛ konɛ mɛ hu a ya tsɔɔ ni kpahi.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Mo mia o hɛ mi kaa ami nɔuu ngɛ nɔ nami mi kaa Yesu Kristo ta hwulɔ kpakpa. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Nɛ kaa Kristo ta hwulɔ ɔ, o ko ha nɛ je nɛ ɔ mi níhi nɛ a puɛ o be. Ejakaa ke o pee ja a, o be tatsɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyɛe maa sa. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Moo ye Nutsɔ ɔ mlaa amɛ a nɔ ngɛ e ni tsumi ɔ mi, kaa bɔ nɛ fo malɔ yeɔ mlaahi a nɔ, aloo ke e yi nɔ ɔ, a jeɔ lɛ ngɛ mi nɛ e nine sui kunimi yemi nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Kaa bɔ nɛ ngmɔ hulɔ tsuɔ ni wawɛɛ nɛ e naa he se ɔ, mo hu mo tsu ni ja a nɔuu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Mo susu nɔ́ nya tsɔɔmi etɛ nɛ ɔmɛ a he, nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ maa ye kɛ bua mo nɛ o nu a sisi bɔ nɛ a kɔɔ o he ha.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />O hɛ nɛ ko je nɔ gblee kaa Yesu Kristo nɔ nɛ je Matsɛ David weku ɔ mi ɔ, nɔ nɛ gbo nɛ e te si ekohu kɛ je gbeje ɔ, Nɔmlɔ adesa kɛ Mawu ji lɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Anɔkuale nɛ ɔmɛ a fiɛmi he je nɛ i ngɛ pimi mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ, nɛ a wo mi tsu kaa awi yelɔ. Se a wui Mawu Munyu ɔ lɛɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ, ami nɛ a wo. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ma suɔ nɛ ma hi pimi mi hluu, ke lɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ ma ha nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ Mawu hla a, a nine maa su Kristo Yesu yi wami hemi kɛ neneene hɛ mi nyami ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Anɔkuale munyu nɛ woɔ mi bua ji kaa, ke wa na nɔ nɛ wa gbo kɛ ha Kristo ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa waa kɛ lɛ ma ya hi si ngɛ hiɔwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Nɛ ke wa susu kaa e sɔmɔmi mwɔnɛ ɔ wa a, wa kai kaa waa kɛ lɛ ma ya hi si nɛ wa maa ye matsɛ ligbi ko. Ke wa mia we wa hɛ mi ngɛ nɔ nami mi se wa kpa ngɛ Kristo se ɔ, lɛ hu e ma kpa ngɛ wa se. <verse eid="2TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Ke wa gbede nɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi ta po ɔ, anɔkualetsɛ ji lɛ nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua wɔ, ejakaa e be nyɛe ma kua wɔ nihi nɛ wa ji lɛ nitsɛ e níhi ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya sami nɛ he be se nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Mo ha nɛ o ni ɔmɛ nɛ a le kikɛmɛ a anɔkuale nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ o fa mɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi nɛ a ko sa nya ngɛ níhi nɛ a he be se nami he, ejakaa kikɛmɛ a nya sami nɛ ɔmɛ a he be se nami, a tsakaa nɔ juɛmi nɛ a yeɔ nɔ awi tete. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Mo tsu ni kɛ o he wami kulaa konɛ Mawu nɛ ha mo ayekoo. Moo pee o he ni tsulɔ kpakpa, nɔ nɛ zo be lɛ gbee ke Mawu ka o ni tsumi ɔ hyɛ ha. Moo le nɔ́ nɛ e munyu ɔ ngɛ dee kɛ nɔ́ nɛ e tsɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Nɛ o yu o he kɛ je yakayaka ni sɛɛmi nɛ woɔ pɛ nɛ kɛ yayami nɛ ji mi mi fumi baa a he. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />A maa tu munyu nɛ maa sã mo, nɛ e maa dɔ mo be kɛkɛɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Himeneo kɛ Fileto nɛ suɔ nya sami a ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />A ngmɛɛ anɔkuale blɔ ɔ he, nɛ a ngɛ lakpa fiɛmi fiɛe ke gbogboehi a si temi ɔ ba mi momo, nɛ a kɛ gbɔjɔ ni komɛ nɛ bu mɛ tue ɔ a hemi kɛ yemi.<verse eid="2TI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Se Mawu anɔkuale ɔ maa si kpɛii kaa tɛ, nɛ nɔ ko be lɛ nyɛe ma huanya. E ji sisi tomi tɛ nɛ a ngma ngɛ nɔ ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ le lɛ nitsɛ e ni ɔmɛ,” nɛ, “Nɔ nɛ tsɛɔ e he Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ, e ko pee níhi nɛ dɛ blɔ.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Tsa pi sika tsu níhi kɛ sika hiɔ nihi kɛkɛ nɛ ngɛ sikatsɛ we mi, se mohu tso kɛ zu níhi hu ngɛ. Níhi nɛ a he jua wa a, a kɛ hyɛɔ nibwɔhi a nɔ, nɛ níhi nɛ a he jua wɛ ɔ, a tsuɔ a he ni ngɛ la tɛ kpata mi aloo a kɛ dwɔmi woɔ a mi. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Ke o je o he kɛ je yayami mi ɔ, o ma plɛ sika tsu ni nɛ ɔmɛ eko nɛ a buu ngɛ we mi, nɛ Kristo nitsɛ maa ngɔ mo kɛ ha e ni tsumi kpakpa.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Moo ma nɔ nɛ haa nihewi juɛmi yaya a nya fo, nɛ o pɛtɛ nɔ nɛ tsɔɔ mo kpakpa peemi blɔ ɔ he. Mo na suɔmi kɛ hemi kɛ yemi, nɛ o kɛ nihi nɛ suɔ Nutsɔ ɔ, nɛ a ngɛ tsui nɛ mi tsɔ ɔ nɛ bɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />I ngɛ mo dee ekohu ke, o kɛ o he nɛ ko wo yakayaka nya sami nɛ kɛ mi mi fumi baa a mi. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />E sɛ kaa Mawu bimɛ peeɔ a he pɛli, se mohu a pee a he kpoo nɛ a kɛ tsui si tomi nɛ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ ngɛ tɔe ɔ ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Nɛ ke o ngɛ nihi nɛ hɛɛ juɛmi kpa ni tsɔɔe ɔ, ba o he si ha mɛ, ejakaa ngɛ Mawu yemi kɛ buami nya a, ke o kɛ mɛ tu munyu ngɛ he si bami kɛ bumi mi ɔ, a ma tsake a tsui nɛ a ma he anɔkuale ɔ ye. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Kɛkɛ a maa nu a he lo sisi nɛ a maa je Abosiami nyɔguɛ yemi klama a mi, nɔ́ nɛ e kɛ nuu mɛ be nɛ e suɔ ɔ. Kɛkɛ ɔ, a maa pee Mawu suɔmi nya ni jehanɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Timoteo, na nɛ o le enɛ ɔ hu kaa ngɛ nyagbe ligbi ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, Kristo se nyɛɛmi maa wa saminya. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ejakaa nimli maa suɔ sika kɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ pe a he. A maa pee a he fiali, he nɔ woli kɛ Mawu he fɛu yeli, fɔli a nɔ tue gboli kɛ nimli nɛ li sina, nimli nɛ puɛ kulaa kɛ pi si. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />A maa pee a he nimli nɛ tsui wa, nɛ kplɛɛ we nɔ, lakpatsɛmɛ, pɛ woli, juɛmi yayatsɛmɛ, basabasa nimli nɛ a yi kpɛti wa kɛ nimli nɛ yeɔ kpakpa peeli a he fɛu. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />A maa tsɔɔ a huɛmɛ a se blɔ, nɛ a maa pee a he yi mi wali, he woli nɛ dii akɔnɔ níhi a se pe Mawu jami. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />A peeɔ a he kaa a ngɛ Mawu jae mohu, se a kua e mi he wami ɔ. O kɛ jamɛ a nimli ɔmɛ nɛ ko bɔ.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ juɔ si kɛ ya sɛɛ nihi a wehi a mi nɛ a kɛ yakayaka yihi nɛ yayami ye a nɔ ɔ, a ya bɔɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ mɛ a jami he ɔmɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Yihi kaa ja amɛ nyɛɔ tsɔɔli hehi a se be fɛɛ be, se a nyɛ we nɛ a leɔ anɔkuale ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ teɔ si kɛ siɔ anɔkuale ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ Yane kɛ Yambre te si kɛ si Mose ɔ. A ji nihi nɛ a yi mi puɛ, nɛ a te si kɛ si Kristo se nyɛɛli a jami ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Se a be a he yee ngɛ enɛ ɔ mi kɛ ya nyagbe. Ejakaa be ko maa su nɛ a nɔ mlɔɔmi ɔ maa je kpo paa ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ hɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ Yane kɛ Yambre a yayami ɔ je kpo ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Se moo lɛɛ o kase mi nɛ o na kaa tsa pi jamɛ a nɔmlɔ ji mi. O le nɔ nɛ i heɔ yeɔ kɛ ye je mi bami kɛ nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ hlae. O le ye hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Kristo mi kɛ bɔ nɛ i na nɔ ha. O le bɔ nɛ i suɔ mo kɛ tsui si tomi nɛ i ngɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />O le amanehluhi nɛ i na ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi mi. O le níhi nɛ ba ye nɔ ɔmɛ kulaa benɛ i ya slaa Antiokia kɛ Ikonium kɛ Listra a, se Nutsɔ ɔ je mi kɛ je kulaa mi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Niinɛ, nihi kulaa nɛ hlaa kaa a maa hi klɔuklɔu si himi ngɛ Kristo Yesu mi ɔ, nihi nɛ sume lɛ ɔ maa wa mɛ yi mi. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Anɔkuale mi ɔ, nimli yayamihi kɛ lakpa tsɔɔli ma puɛ kɛ be nɔ kɛ yayami peemi nɛ a maa mlɔɔ nihi fuu kaa bɔ nɛ Abosiami mlɔɔ mɛ nitsɛmɛ hu ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Se moo lɛɛ moo hɛɛ níhi nɛ a tsɔɔ mo nɛ ɔ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ mi ɔmɛ a mi. O le kaa a ji anɔkuale, ejakaa o heɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ tsɔɔ mo ɔ yeɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />O le kaa o jokuɛwi a si nɛ a tsɔɔ mo Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ pee mo ni lelɔ nɛ o he Mawu yi wami hemi ɔ ye kɛ gu Kristo Yesu nɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ngmami tsuaa Ngmami nɛ a ngɔ ha wɔ ɔ je Mawu Mumi ɔ mi, nɛ e hi kɛ ha anɔkuale tsɔɔmi, konɛ wa yɔse nɔ nɛ hi ngɛ wa si himi mi. E kaa wa hɛ mi nɛ e daa wɔ, nɛ e tsɔseɔ wɔ nɛ waa pee nɔ nɛ da. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />E ji Mawu blɔ nya tomi nɛ e kɛ dlaa wɔ nɛ waa hi kɛ pi si nɛ waa pee nɔ fɛɛ nɔ kpakpa.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo slɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ mo fae ngɛ Mawu kɛ Kristo Yesu hɛ mi, nɔ nɛ ma ba kojo hɛ kali kɛ ni gbogboehi be nɛ e ma ba to e matsɛ yemi ɔ sisi ɔ kɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Moo fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ be fɛɛ be, deka ngɛ jio, deka be jio. Mo ka a hɛ mi nɛ o tsɔɔ mɛ nɔ nɛ da, nɛ o wo mɛ he wami, nɛ o kɛ tsui si tomi nɛ tsɔɔ mɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ be fɛɛ be.<verse eid="2TI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ejakaa be ko maa ba nɛ a be anɔkuale tsɔɔmi ɔ tue bue, se mohu a ma hla tsɔɔli nɛ ma de mɛ nɔ nɛ pɛ tue nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a bu ɔ se blɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />A be Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ tue bue, nɛ a maa nyɛɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a tsɔɔmi kpɛkpɛɛ ɔ se.<verse eid="2TI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />O hɛ nɛ ka si, nɛ o ko ye nɔ́ nɛ o maa na ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ he gbeye. Mo kpaka nihi kɛ ba Kristo ngɔ, nɛ o ko si nɔ ko nɛ sa kaa o pee ngɛ o tsɛmi ni tsumi ɔ mi.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />I ngɛ enɛ ɔ dee, ejakaa i be si hie, ye be su ta nɛ e be kɛe nɛ i ma si je ɔ mi. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />I hwu Nutsɔ ɔ ta a be kɛkɛɛ kɛ ye nyɛmi kulaa nɛ i ye lɛ anɔkuale ngɛ kulaa mi. Jehanɛ ɔ ye ta kpami be ɔ su nɛ i ma ya jɔɔ ye he. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Nɔ nɛ fɔɔ si ngɛ mi mlɛe ngɛ hiɔwe ji dami jlasi ɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ ji dami sane yelɔ ɔ ma ha mi ngɛ e bami ligbi ɔ nɔ. Nɛ pi ami nɔ kake nɛ e ma ha, se mohu nihi kulaa nɛ a je mi bami tsɔɔ kaa a ngɛ e bami ɔ blɔ hyɛe ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyagbe Slɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />I kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o ba nɔuu, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />ejakaa Dema si mi; akɛnɛ e suɔ je nɛ ɔ mi akɔnɔ níhi he je ɔ, e je ye he kɛ ho Tesalonika ya. Kreske ho Galata ya, Tito hu ho Dalmatia ya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka pɛ nɛ e kɛ mi ngɛ. Moo ngɔ Marko kɛ piɛ o he kɛ ba, ejakaa e he ngɛ mi hiae. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tihiko lɛɛ i tsɔ lɛ Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Bɔɔ mɔde nɛ o ngɔ kootu ɔ nɛ i je he ngɛ Troia ngɛ nyɛminyumu Karpo ngɔ ɔ kɛ ba, kɛ womi ɔmɛ hulɔ, titli ɔ, lohwe he womi ɔmɛ nɛ a ngma ni ngɛ a nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Aleksandro, sɔlɔ ɔ pee mi yayami wawɛɛ. I ngɔ e sane ɔ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ; <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />se moo hyɛ o he nɔ nɛ hi ngɛ e he, ejakaa e te kɛ si nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ wa de ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Be mi nɛ a kɛ mi ya kojolɔ ɔ hɛ mi kekle ɔ, a ti nɔ ko nɔ ko ya sɛ́ mi; mɛ kulaa a tu fo si mi, nɛ ye suɔmi nya ji a kɛ mɛ nɛ ko ye ngɛ he. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Se Nutsɔ ɔ fí ye se nɛ e wo mi he wami nɛ i fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ je ɔ tsuo. Nɛ e ha we nɛ a ngɔ mi kɛ ha jata amɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Nutsɔ ɔ ma je mi daa kɛ je nɔ́ yayahi kulaa mi, nɛ e kɛ mi maa ya e hiɔwe matsɛ yemi ɔ mi. A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Mawu kɛ ya neneene. Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />I biɔ Priska kɛ Akuila kɛ Onesiforo we ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasto ngɛ Korinto, se i si Trofimo nɛ be he wami ɔ ngɛ Mileto.<verse eid="2TI 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Bɔɔ mɔde nɛ o ba hiɛ ɔ loko ji fiɛ be ɔ nɛ su. Eubulo kɛ Pude kɛ Lino kɛ Klaudia kɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ kulaa ke a biɔ mo. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ o mumi ɔ nɛ hi si; nɛ e dloomi ɔ hu kɛ mo nɛ hi si.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>